  "new_feature": "Fixed-width recurrent interface for the Recurrent Tsetlin Machine: 480 clause activations are XOR-folded into 48 bins, kept at two EMA timescales and thresholded to a 96-bit Boolean state fed back at the next step. Evaluated on a new reproducible Boolean finite-state-machine benchmark with ablations, raw-feedback and no-feedback controls.",
  "feature_type": "architecture",
